NO LAB FIGURE MAY BE QUOTED AS A SAVING. The reduction here is 16.2x
where the owner's forest will see 2.34x, because the laboratory's
descriptors are reused 22.3 times against production's 2.46. What this
run establishes is that the change is correct and complete on a real
capture. What it saves on nine domains is a production re-judge.

